I've already taken that out.


01:18:42.552 --> 01:18:45.222
And you're giving me the rest.


01:19:49.286 --> 01:19:50.954
- Thanks.
- You all right?


01:19:51.037 --> 01:19:52.455
Yeah, it's bad enough,


01:19:52.539 --> 01:19:55.041
